  <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true">I got back to camp, an empty camp, at 1p.  I laid down but could not rest.  I had no food.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true">I rested my spine and shoulders prone as I melted more snow and used my last electrolyte.  I decamped listening to Grace Slick and the Great Society on my phone, later some Iguanacondas.  A hawk-like fellow came to visit me and we talked.  </p>


  



































  
    
  

    

    

    
